Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答对了  迪恩  你的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean -- your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能战斗  不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fight. I can't walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我能做一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的材料足够做成炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got everything we need to build a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们在做什么  - 我们在猎杀鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we doing? - We're hunting a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道什么人才信有鬼吗  疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who does that? Crazy people!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是  疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We...are insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天  我们去杀魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow we hunt the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们生命的最后一个夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our last night on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着它去找路西法  迎面给他一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this thing to Lucifer and empty it into his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'd never hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的混蛋  你给我记着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会亲手杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你的心挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to rip your heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.29,0:00:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你心中愤怒的火焰烧得更猛烈些吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep fanning that fire in your belly --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:00:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你压抑的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that pent-up rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:00:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.82,0:01:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(格伦伍德斯普林斯精神病院)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(凯彻姆市  俄克拉荷马州)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(精神评估  病人:弗莱彻  苏珊  年龄:43  女性  拥有护理资质)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(小男孩清晨惨死在着火的家中)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护士告诉我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nurses tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不肯吃药\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, uh, you're not taking your medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能告诉我为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Susan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那药让我犯困\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pills make me sleepy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不能睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.02,0:01:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我睡了  它就会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I sleep, it'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事我们已经谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we have talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它杀了安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it killed Annie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏珊  你患了精神分裂症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Susan, you're schizophrenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的精神  会有错乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind plays...tricks on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令你迷惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候你会产生幻视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you see things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我清楚自己的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如我能看见我死去的儿子站在你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I can see my dead son standing right behind you --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:57.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那怪物是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the monster -- it is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安妮曾是你的室友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie was your roommate,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生在她身上的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happened to her was painful --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.59,0:02:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许想象出一个怪物  会比直面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it's easier for you to conjure up a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她自杀的惨象  更容易让你接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}than to face how tragic her suicide really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夜里我能听到它的嚎叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear it at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在墙壁里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.69,0:02:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Susan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界上没有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no such thing as monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十点三十分  熄灯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 10:30  lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.33,0:03:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们今晚闹得真早\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're starting early tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(病史)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芝加哥有位巴巴医生推荐你们过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were referred to me by a Dr. Babar in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是有本关于大象的童话书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there a children's book about an elephant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫做《巴巴家族》的\N{\fnArial\fs30}named Babar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:36.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有关于大象的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any elephant books.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生  我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, doctor, I-I think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:43.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那位医生已经没有办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doc was in over his head with this one
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我弟弟他\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause my brother's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不必了  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's -- that's really not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说说你现在感觉如何吧  亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell me how you're feeling, Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  好吧  有一点点不开心  我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, okay, a little depressed, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  知道原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Any idea why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是因为  我引发了天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably because I started the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为是你引发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think you started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:22.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了一个恶魔  莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed this demon -- Lilith --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心把路西法从地狱放了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I accidentally freed Lucifer from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在世间横行  我们正在试图阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now he's topside, and we're trying to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.99,0:05:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me. And him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, this one angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  你的守护天使?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you mean like a -- like an angel on your shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  他叫卡西迪奥  穿一件风衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. His name's Castiel. He wears a trench coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白我的意思了吧  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I mean, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子为这事恼恨自己几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the kid's been beating himself up about this for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启并不是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse wasn't his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个恶魔  叫露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this other demon -- Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她害他对恶魔血上了瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got him addicted to demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到最后  他整瓶整瓶的灌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, near the end, he was practically chugging the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟并不邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother's not evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏激\N{\fnArial\fs30}High.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  能麻烦您尽快治好他  好让咱哥俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, could you fix him up so we can get back
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以重回游走全国灭鬼杀灵的生活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to traveling around the country and hunting monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erma...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,取消我的午餐时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cancel my lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,富勒医生希望你俩都留院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Fuller would like to keep you both under observation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,观察几日\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩  我也留吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both? Me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  宝贝  医生认为这样最好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sugar. The doctor thinks that would be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我要为你做个简单的体检\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm just gonna give you a little checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:41.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  拉契特护士  就别拐弯抹角了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, nurse Ratched, let's get one thing straight --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.53,0:06:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是看过《飞越疯人院》的  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen "Cuckoo's nest," So don't try
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.73,0:06:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别和我说精神分析那套狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}any of that soul-crushing authoritarian crap on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okeydokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  下一项了  把裤子脱了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you can go ahead and take down your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:55.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  为  为什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What -- what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.53,0:07:18.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"净身"浴的感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your silkwood shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  很好  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  水压恰到好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, um... good water pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the nurse --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常地周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was very thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同意  同意  很周到  很彻底  同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. Good. Good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信我竟然被你说服了来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I let you talk me into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们应该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's the least we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:41.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁救了老爸的次数我们数都数不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin saved dad's ass more times than we can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个了不起的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a great hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经是  直到阿尔伯克基那事为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was. Until Albuquerque.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说我只是希望能有点儿事忙忙  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I-I just figure it's best we keep busy. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为啥要忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look -- um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.63,0:07:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前几周  你让我感到担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}last few weeks, you kind of been worrying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:01.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  萨姆  别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, sam. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  别以为我们进了精神病院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just because we're in the looney bin
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就真可以拿我当疯子看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't give you the right to head-shrink me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  艾伦和乔的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Ellen and Jo dying --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  这确实非常悲惨  我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was a freakin' tragedy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我绝不会就此意志消沉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not gonna wallow in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你就是一直在消沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you always do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:12.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能再这么下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just keep this crap in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  他在那儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  你俩都长这么大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you boys got big.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢称赞  你也不错  马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. You do, too, martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  谢谢你们能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:46.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是当年\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the old days,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是两只手被绑在身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've taken care of this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也能解决了这怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}with both hands t-tied behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.02,0:08:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我们这次的猎杀目标是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what do you think it is that we're hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也完全摸不着头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂  恶魔  怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost, demon, monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动物  植物也或是矿物质东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animal, vegetable, mineral.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医院在过去的四个月里出了五起命案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hospital's had five deaths in the last four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生们全都认定为自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors keep calling it suicides,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:13.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你见过这怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you've seen this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人看见过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone seen this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些病人见过  在眼前闪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a couple of patients have, uh, had glimpses,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都见得的很少\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's not a lot to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they reliable?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  为什么不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure. Why wouldn't they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:34.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我也说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道在你们眼里我是个老废物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you boys think I'm a bag of loose screws.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想的可能没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wouldn't be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但若不是这儿真有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wouldn't have called you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会打电话通知你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless there was something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能察觉到它的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it in my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你有检查过那些尸体吗  有发现受攻击的迹象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you checked any of the bodies, found signs of an attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:10:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't go around dead b-bo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再靠近尸体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}b-bodies anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:04.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历克斯  埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴看到你们已经交到了朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad to see you're making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你们和奎恩先生一起加入我们的小组吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you and Mr. Creaser join us for group?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了  这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我打算让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I'm going to be putting you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:21.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,参加下午的那个组\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the afternoon group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦白地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to be frank, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和你弟弟互相依赖的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}the relationship that you have with your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems dangerously codependent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:32.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为适度的分开对你俩都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think a little time apart will do you both good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:40.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  谁想最先发言呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, who would like to start us off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  泰德  冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Ted. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.09,0:10:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.43,0:10:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相当冷静地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd very calmly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:10:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈论猎杀我们的那个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like to talk about the monster that's hunting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:00.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰德  我们不再讨论那个话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ted, we're not going to have that discussion again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对小组没有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not good for group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.83,0:11:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么对小组没好处吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what else isn't good for group?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怪物会把我们都吃了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster eating all our faces off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  很好  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-其他人要发言吗  - 当它杀死苏珊的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, anyone else. - I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it killed susan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我也看到了  它有很大的钳子  - 不  不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did, too. It had big lobster claws. - No, it didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像外星人  就像《X档案》里的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and it was an alien, like on "X-files."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮忙  听我讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop helping! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.19,0:11:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.99,0:11:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰德  你是要我叫护理员来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Ted, do you need me to call the orderlies...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是规矩点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or can you behave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会守规矩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.49,0:11:51.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}King me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是埃里卡·卡特赖特医生  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dr. Erica Cartwright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我负责你的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been assigned your case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的心理医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my shrink?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:12:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好  我真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你是我的多疑加精神分裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're my paranoid schizophrenic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并带有自恋和人格混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}with narcissistic personality disorder
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和宗教精神分裂的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and religious psychosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实有些问题想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've actually got some questions for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:18.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真巧  我也有些要问你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a coincidence. I've got some for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  你问我答  克拉丽斯 (出自《沉默的羔羊》)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, quid pro quo, Clarice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  汉尼拔  我先问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Hannibal. I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.56,0:12:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你晚上睡几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many hours a night do you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几天睡3 4个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three or four every couple of nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能告诉我关于近来这里的自杀事件吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you tell me about the recent suicides in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.39,0:12:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:34.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你注意到有什么奇怪的事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you haven't noticed anything strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如有没有黑烟  硫磺这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like, I don't know, black smoke, sulfur?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  怎么这么问  什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why? What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有恶魔的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猎杀恶魔  怪物  类似这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hunt demons, monsters -- that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.83,0:12:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你每周饮酒多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many drinks do you have a week?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时我设法入睡  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to sleep sometime, so --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本不睡觉的时候都在喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's seven days 24 times --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50年代中期的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's somewhere in the mid-50s.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有个地方特别冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever feel any, uh, any cold spots
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者走在医院的时候觉得寒气逼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or get a chill walking through the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.66,0:12:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记不得了  如果有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I can remember. If I had?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它表示有鬼魂在周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means there's a ghost around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.69,0:13:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上一次和别人长时间交往是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you were in a long-term relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,界定一下这个"长期"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "Long-term."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:06.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超过两个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.39,0:13:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,病人的报告里有没有比较离奇的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the patients reported seeing anything weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.59,0:13:14.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里吗  一直都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here? All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们来谈谈你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}...let's talk about your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是《陷入绝境》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got "Thraped."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  不  我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no, I am not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:41.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你发现了什么了吗  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me you found something. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人说他见到过什么  找他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy says he saw the creature. We should talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小时后回到这里见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to meet back here in an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  最早解决这个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The sooner we take care of this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以越早离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner we can get gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方让我毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.66,0:14:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫温蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方也不是那么得不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this place isn't so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.66,0:14:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot hit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泪奔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so torn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候了  护士们在巡视\N{\fnArial\fs30}About time. Nurses are on their rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有大概15到20分钟  那家伙在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got, like, 15, 20 minutes. Where is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,306号房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room 306.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧  加油  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up! Come on! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, back off, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现了些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.47,0:15:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发现了什么  - 在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you got? - Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:30.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个孔穿透了他的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}This hole goes all the way through to his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谜底要我们揭晓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以在门口守着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.25,0:16:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来看  他的脑里被吸干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look -- his brain's been sucked dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮  有人过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fascinating. Somebody's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you boys doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就要布丁嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:16:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  过来  跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装疯卖傻才有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy works.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是原版的小丑杀人狂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those original gacys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那都是我画的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I painted those.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是讨论重点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back on point, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不管那个东西是什么  - 画得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um so whatever this thing is... - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它啜食人的脑子  直到吸干为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}...i-it slurps your brain -- sucks you dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.43,0:17:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  所以看上去像是自杀一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, then it makes the deaths look like suicides.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.87,0:17:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bad one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我敢赌一份鸡肉大餐这就是我们要对付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I bet you a chicken dinner it's what we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wraith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们打开你的脑壳  吸食你的脑汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They crack open skulls and feed on brain juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.07,0:17:48.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你以前遇到过吗  - 从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever tangle with one before? - Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也从来都不想遇到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never wanted to, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你甚至只要拿银器碰下死灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You so much as touch a wraith with the stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它的皮肤就会裂开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the skin will crackle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这个是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏消息是  它们能伪装成人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad news is... they can pass as humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它可以伪装成这里任何一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be any Peter, Paul, or Mary in the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  那我们怎么找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic. So how do we find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相传死灵会被镜子照出本相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lore says a wraith will show its true form in a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  看来我们得一个一个检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, we just got to spot-check
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的病人和医院职工都得查\N{\fnArial\fs30}every patient and every staff member.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.67,0:18:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  它在一家精神病院做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I mean, what's it doing in a mental hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一家疯人院\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nuthouse --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就是个完美的密封食物储藏室啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's -- it's -- it's a perfect captive victim pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会相信一个精神病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who -- who's gonna believe a patient
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:30.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说自己看见了一个怪物呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they say they saw a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就是个完美的狩猎场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the perfect hunting ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在猎杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.40,0:18:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是一个死灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wraith, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它可能是任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我也可能是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... I could be a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:19:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  你没嫌疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么为什么是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么猎杀怪物的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to hunt monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不让别人去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not let someone else do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.13,0:19:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我找不到第二个这么蠢的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find anybody else that dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人去救别人的小命儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to save people's asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的也包括在内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours included.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  是不是有什么工作量要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is there a quota?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须要救多少人才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people do you have to save?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.73,0:19:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你必须拯救所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you have to save everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  全民运动  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Whole wide world of sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  无论你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me -- whatever you've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都听过更奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到世界末日了  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end of the world, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:47.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  这可是圣经里提到的天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's the damn biblical apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且如果我不阻止它并且救下所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't stop it and save everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.90,0:19:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没有人能救我们了  我们都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then no one will, and we all die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:54.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可真糟啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  不用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  不管什么天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, apocalypse or no apocalypse,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不管什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}monsters or no monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肩上的担子可不轻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a crushing weight to have on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要想想六十亿人的生命全都靠你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To feel like six billion lives depend on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会情愿每天面对这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you get up in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.63,0:20:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找了三个护士站才找到这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to raid three nurses' stations to get these.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.23,0:20:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只是镀银的  但应该管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're only silver-plated, but they should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.87,0:20:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  别别别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天不行  甜心  好了  继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today, sweetheart. Come on. Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.07,0:20:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就想要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.37,0:21:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可比你强壮多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's larger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少她是个人类(暗指之前恶魔和狼人)\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,富勒今晚值班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuller is on call tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.53,0:21:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们得等熄灯后对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we'll have to hit him after lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们三个都去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.23,0:21:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁  我们得避过保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin, we got to get past the security,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有护工\N{\fnArial\fs30}past the orderlies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后切开那个怪物的喉咙  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then cut the boss man's throat, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实从头至尾都会很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna suck start to finish,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们真的需要支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we could use the backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.67,0:21:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.30,0:21:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.53,0:21:34.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道在阿尔伯克基发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what happened in Albuquerque.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  我以前就像你们俩一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}God...I used to be just like you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.67,0:21:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前一直以为自己是不可战胜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think I was invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是后来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.43,0:21:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现我并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I found out I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁  你依旧是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin. You are still a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.87,0:21:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:52.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得我干吗去调查加州旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you think I checked myself into the hotel California?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本该尽我所能的帮助你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd give anything to help you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很想那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还在大楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.90,0:22:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去西面找  我看看东面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the west wing. I'll take the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.17,0:23:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看他的胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at his arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤口没有燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cut's not burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.17,0:23:33.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是死灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:23:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点都不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.90,0:24:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我...我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I...I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:07.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.12,0:24:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爽呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.93,0:24:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们给你打针了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They give you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.15,0:24:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.74,0:24:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们  该不该打的都打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They -- they gave me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.52,0:24:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.31,0:24:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那简直是太让人激  动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's spectacu...lacular.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.91,0:24:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直是个快乐的小醉汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always were a happy drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.94,0:24:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.24,0:24:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个医生不是死灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor wasn't a wraith.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.98,0:24:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.24,0:24:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我当时在镜子里面看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I saw it in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.76,0:24:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.58,0:24:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是你幻视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或...或...或许你真的要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe -- m-maybe -- maybe you're going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.48,0:24:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.68,0:24:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.54,0:24:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得  你已经  半疯好一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you've been at least... half crazy for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.71,0:24:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从你从地狱回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you got back from hell --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至可能在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or since before that, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.94,0:24:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们...我们身在精神病院\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're in a -- we're in a mental hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.54,0:24:58.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准  你到头来真的疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma-maybe -- maybe you finally cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.42,0:24:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许现在是真正的  彻底的疯掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe now you are really, for-real crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.30,0:25:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弄错了  就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a mistake. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.99,0:25:09.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会找到那死灵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.30,0:25:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah. I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.51,0:25:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.54,0:25:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.84,0:25:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're my brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.04,0:25:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会永远爱你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I still love ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.38,0:25:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.61,0:25:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今天没来参加我们的谈话治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed our session today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.01,0:25:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点儿忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.08,0:25:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在猎杀那个死灵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still hunting that wraith?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.34,0:25:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们正在死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.81,0:25:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有人死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People die all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  你干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, lady, why don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.70,0:25:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非得管我猎鬼的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}just let me do my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.38,0:25:45.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准我还能救你一命呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe save your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.38,0:25:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心的可不是自己的命 \N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my life that I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.01,0:25:49.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  我很好  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my go-- I am fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.24,0:25:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.74,0:25:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  就算你不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Even you don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.51,0:25:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将自己置身于这么大的压力之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this pressure that you're putting yourself under,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.68,0:25:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有这些自责  这会要你的命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all this guilt -- it's killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.31,0:26:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没法拯救所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.88,0:26:06.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些天你根本没能救到任何人  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, these days, you can't save anybody, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.21,0:26:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你说什么  - 我说的是事实  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd you say?  - The truth, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.21,0:26:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾伦和乔是因为你死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got Ellen and Jo killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.88,0:26:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你朝路西法开枪  却没法干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot Lucifer, but you couldn't gank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.94,0:26:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你阻止不了萨姆去杀莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't stop Sam from killing Lilith,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.54,0:26:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  你还打破了第一道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, oh, yeah, you broke the first seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.74,0:26:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做的一切都是失败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you do is fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.38,0:26:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的觉得你  迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think that you, Dean Winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.58,0:26:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭借普通教育水平和一种无所谓的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a G.E.D. And a give-'em-hell attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.54,0:26:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能将恶魔打败\N{\fnArial\fs30}were gonna beat the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.81,0:26:25.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.11,0:26:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界要玩完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world is gonna burn,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.91,0:26:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对此无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there is nothing that you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.11,0:26:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.68,0:26:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道这些事情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that stuff?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.24,0:26:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.14,0:26:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.31,0:26:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.58,0:26:44.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.98,0:26:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.31,0:26:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.89,0:26:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你瞎呀  她呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, blind?! Her!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.51,0:26:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  那里没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pal, there's nobody there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:01.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不存在  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not real, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.84,0:27:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在你的思想里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.21,0:27:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你就要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you are going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.18,0:27:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.68,0:28:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.51,0:28:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.41,0:28:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.71,0:28:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想和你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.58,0:28:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伤了你我深感抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel horrible about what I did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.31,0:28:12.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.38,0:28:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.11,0:28:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是  为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.11,0:28:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我当时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.88,0:28:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原因不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.38,0:28:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为昨晚的事过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}because after what happened last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.11,0:28:28.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I had a...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.94,0:28:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}moment of clarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.71,0:28:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我意识到  世上根本就没有怪物这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized there's no such thing as monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:44.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听你这么说  我很欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm...glad to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.21,0:28:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.18,0:28:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有怪物的幻想对你来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters are the least
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.50,0:28:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经是微不足道的问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.95,0:28:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现幻觉  人们可以学着适应并且生存下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}People can learn to live with delusions,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.91,0:28:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你内心的那种愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the anger I saw in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.58,0:28:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.51,0:29:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打伤了那两个人  而且你还想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt those two men, and you were going to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.18,0:29:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你对我穷追不舍的时候 \N{\fnArial\fs30}The look in your eyes 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.64,0:29:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你眼中的那种神色\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you came after me --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.81,0:29:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.18,0:29:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像  你已经丧失人性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like you were barely even human.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.44,0:29:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是被附身了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a man possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.98,0:29:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.54,0:29:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}just...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.58,0:29:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能再给我一次机会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you give me a second chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.78,0:29:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这又不是在监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this isn't a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.94,0:29:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以去公共休息室\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be allowed to go to the day room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.18,0:29:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过要有人监督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under supervision.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.48,0:29:41.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.48,0:29:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过如果你再像那样爆发的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if there is one more outburst,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.24,0:29:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就把你转到特殊病患区\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will transfer you to a facility
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.04,0:29:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有专门对付暴力倾向病人的设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's equipped to handle violent patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.41,0:29:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  他们绝不会心慈手软的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And believe me, they will be far, far less forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.81,0:30:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 迪恩  - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.54,0:30:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.61,0:30:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是恶魔之血的问题  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the demon blood, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.28,0:30:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来就不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.58,0:30:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.04,0:30:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有问题的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.68,0:30:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always you --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.88,0:30:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的谎  你的自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lies, your arrogance,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.01,0:30:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你心里的阴暗面\N{\fnArial\fs30}that black spot on your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.51,0:30:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜你所赐  我们都快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're all gonna die because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.61,0:30:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是你一手造成的  - 你害了我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all your fault! - You killed all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个可怜的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.98,0:30:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个心术不正的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You evil son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.18,0:30:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,窝囊废\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.61,0:30:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们全玩儿完了  - 怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're all gonna die! - Freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.54,0:30:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,窝囊废\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.28,0:30:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.38,0:30:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.74,0:30:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone!!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.38,0:30:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开  别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.38,0:30:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我  离我远点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.81,0:30:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我  不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone! I didn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.81,0:30:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.94,0:31:00.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.81,0:31:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.68,0:31:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.38,0:31:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁  马丁  是我  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin, Martin, it's me! It's Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.81,0:31:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.38,0:31:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来糟透了  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You -- you look like hell, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.34,0:31:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实遭透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel -- ike feel lit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.74,0:31:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.81,0:31:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关禁闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.08,0:31:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝  他都发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went crazy, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.14,0:31:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.04,0:31:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going crazy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.94,0:31:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出现幻觉  还有幻听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing things. I'm hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.48,0:31:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.78,0:31:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疯狂就是线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy's the clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.31,0:31:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.71,0:31:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  - 疯狂就是线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - Crazy's the clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.34,0:31:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过了  到底什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you said that. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我和萨姆的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the things that me and Sam have done,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.91,0:31:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我们看见的那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the -- the stuff we've seen --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.91,0:31:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我俩最后都会变成失心疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna end up going guano eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.11,0:31:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是一对口水横流的小疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably end up like a couple of drooling nutbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.81,0:32:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无冒犯之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.18,0:32:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}None taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.18,0:32:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是  我俩在同一天一块发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me and him freaking out on the same day?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.24,0:32:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  这应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it -- it -- it's got to be the...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.58,0:32:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是怪物  - 什么  在哪儿呢  哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The monster. - What?! Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.54,0:32:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not -- no, there's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.28,0:32:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.61,0:32:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这东西不仅仅是以疯子为食呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what if this thing doesn't just feed on the insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.41,0:32:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他可以让人失去心智呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if it makes people insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.08,0:32:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能吗  看起来靠谱儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that possible? Does -- does that seem real?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.08,0:32:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个  我本身虽然也不太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I-I'm -- I'm not the most reliable source
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.21,0:32:32.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠谱儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}on what is "Real,"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.64,0:32:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过听上去  有点道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it sounds -- makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.81,0:32:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.34,0:32:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  所以  我们被传染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so -- s-so we got infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.91,0:32:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西让我们变得和疯子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, something shot us up with crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.61,0:32:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  某种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, something...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.74,0:32:48.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定是我老爸的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it was the ghost of my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.71,0:32:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.48,0:32:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集中精力对付死灵  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus on the wraith, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.38,0:32:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-集中精力  - 好吧  死灵  死灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Focus!  - Right, the wraith. The wraith.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.61,0:32:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  所以是那个死灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so the wraith -- the wraith.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.51,0:32:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他毒害我们的神经\N{\fnArial\fs30}It -- it poisoned us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.74,0:32:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.24,0:33:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是通过毒液  通过  触摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe with venom, you know, by t-- by touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.54,0:33:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者毒液  要么是唾液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or -- or -- or venom or, um, saliva.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.74,0:33:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.74,0:33:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.98,0:33:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温蒂对我和萨姆一通狂亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy! Wendy slobbered all over me and Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.01,0:33:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才被感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we got infected!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.18,0:33:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不能踩在砖缝上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't step on the cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.21,0:33:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this real?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.14,0:34:03.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it is, sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.58,0:34:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.80,0:34:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.10,0:34:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温蒂的病房里有两个病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two patients in Wendy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.27,0:34:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们袭击了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.43,0:34:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你能听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.13,0:34:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.30,0:35:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得追上去杀了那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to get out there and kill that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.72,0:35:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.87,0:35:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.14,0:35:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须去  别无选择  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to. You have no choice, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.74,0:35:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.00,0:35:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.24,0:35:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.04,0:35:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.34,0:35:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.74,0:35:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实世界无法承受你过于强烈的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are far too angry to be out there in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.87,0:35:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-原来是你  - 当然是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You!  - Of course it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.90,0:35:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不说  你们俩还真是辜负师父啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say, you hunters don't exactly live up to your rep.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.97,0:36:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  马丁是个废物  毫无威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Martin's a wreck. He's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.04,0:36:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你和你哥跑进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and your brother come in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.20,0:36:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不加掩饰的说猎杀怪物之类的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}talking tough about killing monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.27,0:36:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样一来  让你们轻易就暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of made you easy to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.34,0:36:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只需要轻轻一碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then all it took was a touch...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.30,0:36:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就难逃我手心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and you were mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.30,0:36:20.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱死这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I love it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.80,0:36:24.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿简直就像我的私人五星级酒店套房\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is my own personal five-star restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.30,0:36:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疯狂的脑内充满了多巴胺和肾上腺素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy brains -- they get soaked in dopamine and adrenaline
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.94,0:36:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,激素与化学反应之间的碰撞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just all sorts of hormones and chemicals
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.43,0:36:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是无比美味可口\N{\fnArial\fs30}that make them delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.47,0:36:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越是疯狂的大脑  越是美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the crazier they are, the better they taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.77,0:36:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.60,0:36:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是有推波助澜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...I helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.04,0:36:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这种愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that rage?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.30,0:36:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不关我的事  是你自己的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. That's all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.04,0:36:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会让人发疯  只是火上浇油而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't make crazy. I just crank up what's already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.00,0:36:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都是你咎由自取\N{\fnArial\fs30}You build your own hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.67,0:37:00.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是提供你机会而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I give you the legos.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.30,0:37:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而一旦等到时机成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you're ripe...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.97,0:37:08.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,则由我来消除你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I make all of your problems disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.47,0:37:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.24,0:37:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子  你真以为自己能搞得定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think this is gonna end well for you, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.28,0:37:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.24,0:37:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但反正我疯了  管他什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm crazy, so what the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.47,0:38:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还疯着呢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.70,0:38:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和平时差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not any more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.24,0:38:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得快离开这鬼地方  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got to get out of here.  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.43,0:38:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来汤姆·克鲁斯说得没错  心理医生烂透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like Tom Cruise was right. Shrinks suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.88,0:38:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.08,0:38:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.39,0:39:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那个死灵  - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, the wraith.  - What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.50,0:39:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.59,0:39:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  反正她死了  行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she wasn't. She's dead, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.18,0:39:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快上路吧  我得喝一杯  或一打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hit the road. I need a drink. Or 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.24,0:39:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然大多数时候我能压抑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the time I can hide it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.37,0:39:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我的确很愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...I am angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.08,0:39:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我痛恨所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm mad at everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.82,0:39:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前痛恨你和爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be mad at you and dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.34,0:39:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后是莉莉丝  现在又是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}then lilith, now it's lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.40,0:39:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找了借口  归咎于露比和恶魔血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and I make excuses. I blame ruby or the demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.14,0:39:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但其实错不在他们  而在于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not their fault. It's not them. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.69,0:39:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在于我的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直充满愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am mad all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.08,0:39:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道自己为什么这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.26,0:39:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.90,0:39:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.66,0:39:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.96,0:39:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备怎样  一走了之吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, take a leave of absence?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.54,0:39:44.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是要答应路西法的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna say yes to Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.34,0:39:45.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.33,0:39:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  当然不是  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not. I --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.34,0:39:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.33,0:39:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你要面对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's exactly what you're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.37,0:39:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要么被这些包袱压垮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna take all that crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.91,0:39:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么就放下包袱  抛开过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna bury it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.05,0:39:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘记所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna forget about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.29,0:39:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如此一来我们才能继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's how we keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.89,0:39:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最后才不会像马丁那么落魄\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we don't end up like Martin!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.21,0:40:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.19,0:40:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说啊  老弟  你同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.27,0:40:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.17,0:40:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.16,0:40:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就他妈的快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get the hell out of here.
